Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 22:51:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(desktop): read T3CODE_DESKTOP_RESOURCES_PATH

Distribution packages that run the app on a shared Electron need to name
the app's resources directory, since process.resourcesPath belongs to
that Electron.

Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 apps/desktop/src/app/DesktopConfig.ts | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/apps/desktop/src/app/DesktopConfig.ts b/apps/desktop/src/app/DesktopConfig.ts
index 11f975a6b86a..b6c62d99f967 100644
--- a/apps/desktop/src/app/DesktopConfig.ts
+++ b/apps/desktop/src/app/DesktopConfig.ts
@@ -56,6 +56,7 @@ export const DesktopConfig = Config.all({
     Config.withDefault("http/json"),
   ),
   desktopLauncherPath: trimmedString("T3CODE_DESKTOP_LAUNCHER_PATH"),
+  desktopResourcesPath: trimmedString("T3CODE_DESKTOP_RESOURCES_PATH"),
   appImagePath: trimmedString("APPIMAGE"),
   disableAutoUpdate: optionalBoolean("T3CODE_DISABLE_AUTO_UPDATE"),
   mockUpdates: optionalBoolean("T3CODE_DESKTOP_MOCK_UPDATES"),

From 5898fe4c1fe61b3acbfd8e5849b83dad799db1d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Andr=C3=A9=20Lima?= <me@limwa.pt>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 22:53:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat(desktop): resolve resources from
 T3CODE_DESKTOP_RESOURCES_PATH

When set, the desktop environment uses it instead of
process.resourcesPath. Every resource lookup (SnapShots helpers, the
browser-secret helper, the resource monitor, app-update.yml, package-type
and the Windows server.asar) already reads environment.resourcesPath, so
they all follow. Unset, nothing changes.

Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 apps/desktop/src/app/DesktopEnvironment.ts | 8 ++++++--
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/apps/desktop/src/app/DesktopEnvironment.ts b/apps/desktop/src/app/DesktopEnvironment.ts
index 1066198b8f61..125ab76efebb 100644
--- a/apps/desktop/src/app/DesktopEnvironment.ts
+++ b/apps/desktop/src/app/DesktopEnvironment.ts
@@ -164,9 +164,14 @@ const make = Effect.fn("desktop.environment.make")(function* (
   });
   const rootDir = path.resolve(input.dirname, "../../..");
   const appRoot = input.isPackaged ? input.appPath : rootDir;
+  // A shared Electron's process.resourcesPath is its own; distribution packages point at the app's.
+  const resourcesPath = Option.match(config.desktopResourcesPath, {
+    onNone: () => input.resourcesPath,
+    onSome: (override) => path.resolve(override),
+  });
   const serverRoot =
     input.isPackaged && input.platform === "win32"
-      ? path.join(input.resourcesPath, "server.asar")
+      ? path.join(resourcesPath, "server.asar")
       : appRoot;
   const branding = resolveDesktopAppBranding({
     isDevelopment,
@@ -183,7 +188,6 @@ const make = Effect.fn("desktop.environment.make")(function* (
     Option.getOrElse(config.xdgDataHome, () => path.join(homeDirectory, ".local", "share")),
     "applications",
   );
-  const resourcesPath = input.resourcesPath;
 
   return DesktopEnvironment.of({
     path,

